{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Welcome to The Lost Painter</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single player, first person, atmospheric, walking simulator exploring liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter your Paintings and explore a world full of mystery and Horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storm the beaches of Normandy, get lost in the Backrooms and Survive the Devils Labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapped inside a Beautiful Art Gallery inside your mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an Artist who is suffering from memory loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your condition begins to deteriorate, you must search past memories, dreams and nightmares to save your most treasured memories and your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/c70fbd6f3fddb14fb789972f6087f131.poster.avif?t=1756233974\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/c70fbd6f3fddb14fb789972f6087f131.webm?t=1756233974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/c70fbd6f3fddb14fb789972f6087f131.mp4?t=1756233974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game features many different linear and unique Liminal levels with some Survival, Puzzles and Escape areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter 4 Large paintings each consisting of various times, locations exploring -</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beaches of Normandy during WW2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1970 England</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1990 England</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Backrooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELL</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/284162acce7eb7727df10c4bd250d027.poster.avif?t=1756233974\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/284162acce7eb7727df10c4bd250d027.webm?t=1756233974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/284162acce7eb7727df10c4bd250d027.mp4?t=1756233974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each painting reflects a period of your life or the life of a family member.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your Grandparents memories of WW2 to your most treasured nostalgic memories of your childhood and teenage years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also explore dreams and nightmares and watch how your minds' art gallery changes as you make progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/7295aff7d4f3fb3845afb32009250ca2.poster.avif?t=1756233974\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/7295aff7d4f3fb3845afb32009250ca2.webm?t=1756233974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/7295aff7d4f3fb3845afb32009250ca2.mp4?t=1756233974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game is heavily inspired by the Nostalgic experiences of Liminal Spaces and The Backrooms Phenomena.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/de0e99d28c1c0d91e6e1f2e6ca28e135.poster.avif?t=1756233974\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/de0e99d28c1c0d91e6e1f2e6ca28e135.webm?t=1756233974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/de0e99d28c1c0d91e6e1f2e6ca28e135.mp4?t=1756233974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a level selection page in the menu if you struggle to overcome a certain memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many thanks to anyone who supports my game development and Horror Youtube channel Ravenhome Gamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973630?t=1756233974","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973630?t=1756233974","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/21dbfc4cc7522d9d5e133a69302a0491e0c8b959/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756233974","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/21dbfc4cc7522d9d5e133a69302a0491e0c8b959/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756233974","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Welcome to The Lost Painter</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single player, first person, atmospheric, walking simulator exploring liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter your Paintings and explore a world full of mystery and Horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storm the beaches of Normandy, get lost in the Backrooms and Survive the Devils Labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapped inside a Beautiful Art Gallery inside your mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an Artist who is suffering from memory loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your condition begins to deteriorate, you must search past memories, dreams and nightmares to save your most treasured memories and your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/c70fbd6f3fddb14fb789972f6087f131.poster.avif?t=1756233974\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/c70fbd6f3fddb14fb789972f6087f131.webm?t=1756233974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/c70fbd6f3fddb14fb789972f6087f131.mp4?t=1756233974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game features many different linear and unique Liminal levels with some Survival, Puzzles and Escape areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter 4 Large paintings each consisting of various times, locations exploring -</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beaches of Normandy during WW2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1970 England</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1990 England</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Backrooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELL</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/284162acce7eb7727df10c4bd250d027.poster.avif?t=1756233974\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973630/extras/284162acce7eb7727df10c4bd250d027.webm?t=1756233974\" type=\"v